---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout>
  <h1>Assessments API</h1>

  <h2>Endpoints</h2>

  <table class="key-table">
    <tr>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Path</th>
      <th>Permission</th>
      <th>Purpose</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>GET</code></td>
      <td><code>/api/v1/assessments</code></td>
      <td><code>assessments:view</code></td>
      <td>List assessments (paginated, filterable, CSV/JSON)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>GET</code></td>
      <td><code>/api/v1/assessments/&#123;id&#125;</code></td>
      <td><code>assessments:view</code></td>
      <td>Full detail: vendor, template, questions, responses, findings, comments</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>The list endpoint supports <code>?vendorId=</code>, <code>?status=</code>, <code>?fromDate=</code>, <code>?toDate=</code>, <code>?page=</code>, and <code>?format=csv</code>. The detail endpoint returns every question with its response value, compliance status, weighted score, review decision, and threaded comments.</p>
</DocsLayout>
